" end="00:30.740">nature</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.740" end="00:31.790"><span begin="00:30.740" end="00:31.280">Principle </span><span begin="00:31.280" end="00:31.340">of </span><span begin="00:31.340" end="00:31.790">nature</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.790" end="00:33.950"><span begin="00:31.790" end="00:31.970">That </span><span begin="00:31.970" end="00:32.330">almost </span><span begin="00:32.330" end="00:32.570">every </span><span begin="00:32.570" end="00:33.050">creature </span><span begin="00:33.050" end="00:33.950">knows</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.980" end="00:35.660"><span begin="00:33.980" end="00:34.280">Called </span><span begin="00:34.280" end="00:34.730">survival </span><span begin="00:34.730" end="00:34.850">of </span><span begin="00:34.850" end="00:34.940">the </span><span begin="00:34.940" end="00:35.660">fittest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.660" end="00:36.740"><span begin="00:35.660" end="00:35.930">Survival </span><span begin="00:35.930" end="00:36.200">of </span><span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.470">the </span><span begin="00:36.470" end="00:36.740">fittest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.740" end="00:39.080"><span begin="00:36.740" end="00:36.830">And </span><span begin="00:36.830" end="00:37.100">check </span><span begin="00:37.100" end="00:37.190">it </span><span begin="00:37.190" end="00:37.430">this </span><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:37.550">is </span><span begin="00:37.550" end="00:37.760">how </span><span begin="00:37.760" end="00:37.970">it </span><span begin="00:37.970" end="00:39.080">goes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.110" end="00:41.480"><span begin="00:39.110" end="00:39.347">The </span><span begin="00:39.347" end="00:39.584">animal </span><span begin="00:39.584" end="00:39.821">that </span><span begin="00:39.821" end="00:40.058">eats </span><span begin="00:40.058" end="00:40.295">has </span><span begin="00:40.295" end="00:40.532">got </span><span begin